 This page documents updates to the Gemini API.
 
+## October 13, 2026
+
+- Gemini 4 Argon (`gemini-4-argon`) generally available (GA): Released Gemini 4 Argon (`gemini-4-argon`), our most capable model built for complex coding, agentic, math, and science tasks.
+  For API changes, pricing, and migration guidance, see What's new in Gemini 4 Argon.
+
+## October 8, 2026
+
+- Gemini 3.7 Flash deprecation: `gemini-3.7-flash` is deprecated and has been replaced by `gemini-3.8-flash`. It is no longer available to select in Google AI Studio, and API requests to `gemini-3.7-flash` are automatically routed to `gemini-3.8-flash`. Update your model string to `gemini-3.8-flash` and review the Gemini 3.8 Flash guide.
+- Gemini 3.5 Flash deprecation: `gemini-3.5-flash` is deprecated and has been replaced by `gemini-3.6-flash`. It is no longer available to select in Google AI Studio, and API requests to `gemini-3.5-flash` are automatically routed to `gemini-3.6-flash`. Update your model string to `gemini-3.6-flash` (or `gemini-3.8-flash`) and review the Gemini 3.6 Flash guide.
+- Deep Research Agent `deep-research-pro-preview-12-2025` deprecation: The `deep-research-pro-preview-12-2025` agent is deprecated and will be shut down on October 23, 2026.
+  Migrate your requests to one of the newer Deep Research agent versions:
+  - `deep-research-preview-04-2026`: Designed for speed and efficiency, ideal to be streamed back to a client UI.
+  - `deep-research-max-preview-04-2026`: Maximum comprehensiveness for automated context gathering and synthesis.
+  To migrate, update the `agent` parameter in your `interactions.create` requests from `deep-research-pro-preview-12-2025` to `deep-research-preview-04-2026` (or `deep-research-max-preview-04-2026`).
+
